        "#### 2. The Builder (Handled by `_run_builder`)\n",
        "- **Objective**: The execution engine responsible for transforming the blueprint into a verified set of artifacts.\n",
        "- **Actions**:\n",
        "    - Iterates sequentially through the `Skill` objects defined in the plan.\n",
