        "**Reasoning**:\n",
        "I will implement the refactored `_handle_alfa` method within the `BlackMambaCoordinator` class to act as a dedicated Planner, responsible for generating the trace ID, architectural blueprint, and the sequence of skills for the project memory.\n",
